3b460c440aba6804befe02c947bc79460207678598e6cf40"]]]]],["candidateBinding",["object",[["coverage",["string","Actual published file-key set equals independently planned required artifact roles. Missing required or unexpected referenced files fail; owned intermediate/unreferenced scratch files are excluded from publication and cleaned only when unreachable. Names and implicit-pair relations still satisfy resource-graph/output-layout rules."]],["immutability",["string","A new candidate byte set creates a different binding/verifier context, with the same prior source expectation only if source/options/layout/loss/consent truly unchanged. Source-semantic changes need new planId/consent, not an artifact rebind. Late changed source cannot borrow old binding."]],["when",["string","After actual private candidate bytes have been produced, trusted capture reads every actual candidate file/stream and binds its key/SHA/length in CandidateArtifactBinding to the already registered SourceExpectation digest. This step confers no semantic validity or Saved authority."]]]]],["currentNativeLayerState",["object",[["path",["string","native-layer-current.contract.json"]],["scope",["string","Complete selected3D actual current layer population, native flags/anchors/effective matrix+translation and typed two-reference roles; immutable Source1 history independent. No actual capture/physics/runtime qualification."]],["sha256",["string","2520459d4234be0c44d1302adda079386205b655c84c2d2a8c4e96bf8992f52b"]]]]],["currentNativeLegacyDisplayState",["object",[["currentSchema",["object",[["path",["string","vics-legacy-display-current.schema.json"]],["sha256",["string","2cd6c594c8fb79b8898dd5f1cf6dd8342751c842d5b8362d9ba2ceba6efb32cf"]]]]],["path",["string","vics-legacy-display.contract.json"]],["pointer",["string","/currentStateBinding"]],["registeredTags",["object",[["NativeLegacyDisplayCurrent1",["string","Scene.render Map member nativeLegacyDisplayCurrent"]],["NativeLegacyViewCurrent1",["string","Scene.cameraRaw Map member nativeLegacyViewCurrent"]]]]],["scope",["string","Complete actual current populations and all schema-declared EntityRef roles/global typed bijection; known original31keywords/history separate. Every native-width bit/unused slot persists. No replay from source or capture from encoded projection. Actual Engine derive visitor/restorer is future; schema mismatch refuses complete save."]],["sha256",["string","c8484e37771dbd3094f37e97fab73e2ace7916b26e80f02216d622a9eb3216d7"]]]]],["currentNativeNumericalGrid",["object",[["path",["string","native-scalar-grid-current.contract.json"]],["scope",["string","Registered Source7 actual current numerical SourceEntity/data/mask/geometry distinct from immutable NativeScalarGridSource1 history and active FS/physical Fields. No existing Engine type retagging, import geometry certificate or actual capture implementation."]],["sha256",["string","3908fb5acb5a8e4f06ef211345c70d9fe7fc015b8c5435d21b5990e0ca251237"]]]]],["currentNativeThermalState",["object",[["path",["string","native-thermal-state.contract.json"]],["scope",["string","Actual current native-compatible selectors/scalar+six-slot state proposal, distinct from original history and canonical-only source; no actual Engine/live restore qualification"]],["sha256",["string","b57ff381e7e61c1140341cadd8b437595ded2f95e813781c24e29f5aa8d6d7da"]]]]],["integration",["object",[["exactOldExample",["string","resource-reopen.schema.json/finite witness retain their exact known-artifact SaveExpectation example unchanged. In a real pipeline that exact artifact identity is a candidate-stage binding, while its semantic source objects were independently registered earlier. Do not interpret the finite example registration as proof that PlanEncode predicts compressed bytes."]],["newNonexact",["string","resource-content-comparison handles actual source-versus-output numeric content under an immutable prior budget. The actual artifact-set digest is registered after candidate creation; decoder input isolation and immutable expected source access remain separate."]],["protocol",["string","These new closed values are internal design proposals. Existing protocol3/old sealed messages not extended or admitted. Actual transport migration belongs a versioned implementation card, not silent extra fields."]]]]],["qualification",["object",[["actualEngineImplemented",["bool",false]],["actualHostImplemented",["bool",false]],["designSpecified",["bool",true]],["independentlyReviewed",["bool",false]],["newTargetExecuted",["bool",false]],["whole03Complete",["bool",false]]]]],["reason",["string","PlanEncode writes no output and cannot in general know all exact future JPEG/compressed/native output hashes. The source semantics/layout/coverage are immutable before encode; exact actual bytes must be bound after they exist. Output hashes never redefine the expected source content."]],["schema",["string","FC-save-source-expectation-artifact-binding/3"]],["selectedHistoricalNativeConsumption",["object",[["path",["string","historical-native-record-consumption.contract.json"]],["scope",["string","Complete selected locked numeric-record dispatch and nativeICS six-value TF paired-line consumption. Source/current native slots separate; no historical1991/1986 or correctedSMAT certificate."]],["sha256",["string","d0ef52918c4780870014a6767e91dbb7efda07a908abb6323a97b6ce7d66dcf7"]]]]],["selectedMXDStatisticalObservations",["object",[["path",["string","mxd-statistic-consumption.contract.json"]],["pointer",["string","/observationTree"]],["registeredTag",["string","MXDReportBlockObservations1"]],["roles",["string","Only actual owner and targetSite EntityRef and actual BytesRef leaves participate in fresh typed mapping; source labels/ordinals/tokens are literals. Full all-block/all-row/all-axis observation/source/control conservation, not current coordinate replay or ADP/SU qualification."]],["sha256",["string","98fbf4a704e4e71e0b68372d6e287fd653b2b422dcd8f6190e35b2146695ba0b"]]]]],["selectedNativeNumericalConsumption",["object",[["path",["string","native-numerical-consumption.contract.json"]],["scope",["string","Closed current fractional-native numerical grid, actual effective affine and explicit stored-scalar isoview consumption. Source7 registered types/typed refs/full current state; no active physical reciprocal type, native mesh proof or renderer implementation."]],["sha256",["string","8b4624433b87f4719a1b5774bad9c5079ea7527d6249729e95073d0846fb3ce3"]]]]],["selectedOriginalGSASSpinChart",["object",[["path",["string","gsas-original-spin-chart.contract.json"]],["scope",["string","Original APS revision1253 source-bound SPNFLP generator-mask/centering/timeSign versus axial-factor rule; closed trusted-chart/current-projection roles. No all-historical chart or actual factory/science qualification."]],["sha256",["string","49da20c7bcf6f881aff76e5ded75706278e17370a7312d83335b37f7d4b7d280"]]]]],["selectedSaveTargetPolicy",["object",[["path",["string","save-target-policy.contract.json"]],["scope",["string","D4-31 target selection and exact first-Save binding; selected source authority snapshot, no04 implementation"]],["sha256",["string","93ecc223741109edfcad15b5f1575945d439273601da23e0f5d407030db785a1"]]]]],["sgPersistentRootConservation",["string","sg-persistent-source.contract.json"]],["sourceExpectation",["object",[["bytes",["string","ArtifactRole has no future outputSHA or invented zero-byte default. For source-copied immutable resources a separately bound source hash can already be known; generated bytes are not presumed deterministic. Role/key/owner/reference closure and valid encoding policy must nevertheless be fully planned."]],["objects",["string","requiredObjectKeys must equal exactly once the sourceObjectKey set in requiredObjects. These objects come from independent source capture before lossy EncodeInventory or encoder projection. The encoder cannot remove a source field, raw thermal table, optional-present geometry effect or owner by redefining this set."]],["when",["string","Before Consent/EncodeApproved, Engine independently captures full immutable source and registers SourceExpectation under the existing planId with LossBinding, complete source ledger, expected transitive reference effects/optional outcomes, per-object source content and proposed output owner locators, per-leaf comparison bundle, all required artifact roles/keys and destination/layout/options."]]]]],["validation",["object",[["laterLoad",["string","Ordinary future load doesnot require a prior in-RAM plan. Reconstruct source effects from qualified persisted primary/resource/metadata and independent parse. Capture source semantics and actual artifact identity before exposing completeLoaded; do not use old process caches."]],["postpublish",["string","Capture and compare the real persisted file set under actual host authority, then independently verify full registered source semantics. Candidate result reuse requires identical actual input bytes/rules/provenance. Changed bytes or missing table/field refuse Saved; publication-possible outcomes remain committed-unverified/unknown."]],["prepublish",["string","Independently resolve every actual primary/nested explicit/implicit reference from CandidateArtifactBinding-owned bytes. Compare expected effects/objects/source/precision with SourceExpectation and ComparisonBundle; byte hashes are comparison inputs, not the pass criterion. Same correct grid bytes but no Field remains E_REOPEN_COVERAGE."]]]]],["wire",["string","save-artifact-binding.schema.json"]]]]]]],["object",[["logicalFile",["string","vesta-material:root/output/vesta-study/20261108-113622/reviews/20261115-092025-p1-03-completion/resource-reopen.contract.json"]],["pointer",["string",""]],["projection",["string","complete-selected-JSON-value"]],["value",["object",[["authority",["array",[["string","D01 full-function/source preservation"],["string","D02 4.1 reuse and5 save/export/reopen"],["string","PRD SW6/SW7 andD4-31 actu