/uninterpreted/complete parsed integer records and resource provenance independently of actual current graph/rules. Absence is not observed zero bonds; raw source indices are not current object IDs. Capture current topology separately, require complete expected active objects on fresh reopen, and never replay archived table into changed current model."]],["fdatSymmetrySourceAndCurrent",["string","fdat-symmetry.contract.json: immutable original source ops/CENT/codes/label and actual current qualified phase state are distinct. Complete expected operator sets/frame/image addresses must survive fresh readback; same count/closure/group number, name relookup or replay of original source over edited current state is insufficient. Compact registered rule definitions may be preserved, reference executables are construction evidence only."]],["nativeBondSourceVariant",["string","codec-source-document.schema.json proposal7 +native-bond-format-contract.json: capture/restore all original native recipe identities/full records and separately every qualified SG projection; compare mode1/2/XX/source flags and styles independently. Source recipe presence is not scientific algorithm qualification."]],["nativePersistentObjectFlags",["string","native-flag-state.contract.json NVIS2: capture all five current sets separately from immutable source observations; qualified stable current targets, actual output population/remapping and real restored effects. Never derive current flags from old source records, ordinal reuse, global style or archive SHA. SourceDTO7 roots unchanged; old NVIS1 is source-only predecessor evidence."]],["nativeSectionDialectPolicy",["string","native-legacy-section.contract.json: Source7 typed modern18x80/legacy15x69 union; preserve current complete section state separately from immutable original, exact owner/field/basis/style/matrix/dialect and source qualifiers. Never pad or parse legacy rows as modern; require actual fresh restored expected section coverage, not source metadata presence."]],["producerInlineIncludePolicy",["string","feff10-source.contract.json +resource-graph.schema.json proposal2: exact producer-job base/name map and original include/load occurrence order, recursive capture/cycle/work bounds, all referenced immutable bytes and source current-state separation. Preserve into full source envelope, artifact-only reopen without ambient CWD or replay over edited state. This internal successor changes no productprotocol3/host admission."]],["qualification",["object",[["actualProductDecoderImplemented",["bool",false]],["designSpecified",["bool",true]],["hostImplemented",["bool",false]],["independentlyReviewed",["bool",false]],["nativeRepairExecuted",["bool",false]],["whole03Complete",["bool",false]]]]],["referenceCapture",["object",[["contextResources",["string","This CapturedInput schema coversprimaryfile dependencyreferences. Full decode/save capture also independently enumerates existing typed SourceDescriptor/request frame,dictionary,producercontext and Engine resources; it doesnot replace those schemas. Their boundSourceDescriptorDigest and per-owner ResourceRef identities enter the complete source/resource graph andSaveExpectation."]],["discovery",["string","Read primary bytes without mutating the current Engine. Independently partition all primary blocks into qualified known records or opaque source spans. Eachknown reference-bearing record supplies exact reference/owner/operation spans; implicitGAMESS.same-stem edges haveversioned derivation fromtheir seed. Opaque blocks without a trusted reference-free rule leave closureunresolved; no complete capture/wholeSave claim. Incoming manifests/reference lists are not the independent enumeration."]],["identity",["string","Each explicitreference identity bindsprimarySHA, pathbyteoffset/length/SHA, sourceownerlocator, edgekind and frozenrule/version. An implicit edge instead binds its seedreference (orprimaryname), original derivednamebytes and frozenrule digest; never fabricate a primarybytespan for a filename absentfromthefile. Preserve operations/pathbytes/sourceorder independently. Duplicate identities, overlaps withconflictingmeaning, missingdiscoverededges orunqualifiedderivededge => diagnostic/source-only, no completed load or preservingSave."]],["implicitPairs",["string","SourceReference is aclosed explicit/implicit union. Implicit edges bindtheirseedandtheexact native same-stem .inp/.mmp spelling underfrozenrule/version, not arbitrary independentblobnames. Capture BOTH actualbytes/digests andkeep association/framequalification separatefromfilename discovery. Missing, wrongstem, ambiguousseed oroutofroot derivation isnot joined successfulload."]],["interfaces",["string","Proposed decodeCaptured(primary,profile,CapturedInputContext{reader,bindingSet}) wrapper forfullreference domains; bindingSet validatedagainst independently parsedsource before the existing ResourceReader.resolve(canonicalKey)/read handle is called. Existing decode(bytes,format,reader) andprotocol3 areunchanged/admissionnotexpanded. An unversioned oldclient cannot sendnewbindingfields to gainpermission."]],["legacyParentPaths",["string","A raw original ../../inputs/source.pgrid is sourceprovenance, not a ResourceReader key or permission. Existing authenticated host resolves relative to the captured source primary directory under the actual authorized user root. Parentsegments withinthatroot maybecaptured; rootescape/absolute/unqualifiedencoding/missing authorization fail. Follow actual host realpath policy and its D2-13check/use race limitation; no newglobalfencing claim."]],["materialization",["string","Capture allrequired immutablebytes with source/semanticownership before model replacement. Missing/changed/truncated/unsupportedreferences leave currentactiveproject unchanged. Explicit readonly recovery retains sourceprimary, availableresources, unresolved requests and diagnostics; no completeLoaded, editedSave or zero/defaultField. Resource lease/transfer/budget failure neverdownshifts to emptydocument."]],["nonperiodicEmpty",["string","Zeroatoms isvalidforfield-onlysource anddoesnotmean zeroFields. Real emptydocument isacceptedonlyif independently discovered references/effects andfullsourceaudit areempty/consistent. Resource-count/header mode isnot inferredfieldcount."]],["normalizedKeys",["string","CapturedInput usescanonical safeASCII keys such as source/<referenceId>. Bind raw primary span to thatkey without rewritingoriginalprimarybytes. Immutable NameMap containsownedbytes/hash/length bykey. No codec filesystem/CWD/home/appdir/cache fallback. Input keys andsource IDs are local capture identities, not portable filesystem paths."]],["transitiveAndOptional",["string","resource-graph.contract.json /resource-graph.schema.json: per-file primary contexts, recursive decoder cycle detection, optional same-stem FFE presence/absence and no ambient reopen fallback. referenceGraphDigest includes all nested edges and optional outcomes, not merely a main-file list."]]]]],["saveExpectation",["object",[["comparison",["string","Exactstorage usescanonicalcomponentbits/order andexact descriptor. Nonexact encoding usesa frozenprospective interval/conversionbudget and independentcomparison, not SHA inequality as automatic scientificfailure nor residual-fitted tolerance. SourceSU isnoterrorbudget; losses/changedsemantics needtheexisting completeaudit/consent. No field may disappearunder an allowednumericbudget."]],["fieldMeaning",["string","EveryexpectedField requiresgrid/endpoint/dimension/component/order/cell-or-axis-frame/quantity/unit/sourcequalification descriptor, fullcomponentdata includingmissingmask/nonfinite disposition, per-reference association andpreservedsourceledger. For selected2200bytegrid compareall512f32 bits andactualheader, butsourceunknownquantityremainsunknown. New fieldcreation fromresourceoperations usesqualified source-effect rules; unknownmode/power/component semantics forbids claimed complete projection."]],["objects",["string","ExpectedObject sourceObjectKey is trustedsourceidentity; emittedLocator/ownerLocator are qualifiedwireownerpositions. Freshdecode gets newdocument/epoch/runtimeObjectIds; compare a bijection onemitted semanticlocators/owner/topology/content, not previous runtimeUUID equality. Twoowners sharingbytes remain twoobjects. Opaque/source-onlyobjects requirefullpreservedsource content; theirpresence doesnotbecome scientificcapability."]],["origin",["string","Engine fullimmutable captured source independentlyenumerates everypersistentunit/resourceedge. A frozen route rule maps them to the exact expectedpersistent readback objects andemittedownerlocators plus explicitloss/precision policies. Expecteddescriptor/data/sourceledger digests come fromsource/prospective conversionrules, neverfromtheencodedcandidate orcurrentdisplay."]],["planBinding",["string","Register an immutable SaveExpectation digest with the existing Engine-issued planId, complete source ledger, lossReport/Consent identity, profile, materializedoptions, comparisonrule anddestinationgrant. Changing objects/resources/layout/precision/rules requiresnewplanId andfreshconsent. The caller cannot replace expectedobjects and recomputeitsownhash. Keep this typedvalidationmetadata internal or version its transport; no silent protocol3/closedproposal2 extension."]],["planningAndActualByteIdentity",["string","save-artifact-binding.contract.json: independently pre-register SourceExpectation semantics/objects/roles/budgets before encode; capture exact actual candidate key/SHA/length afterwards in CandidateArtifactBinding tied to that immutable source expectation. The exact finite known-artifact example doesnot imply planning can predict nondeterministic compressed bytes."]],["proposedFullSourcePreservation",["string","native-source-envelope.contract.json: explicit versioned SavedSourceDocument plus sourceSHA primary stamp/manifest2 proposal within existing native+resources layout. No original native/protocol3 admission; full typed restoration plus semantic object coverage required, not hashes/archive alone."]],["purposeScope",["string","NativewholeSave requirescompletepersistentproject content. Data/image/mesh/table/text exports verify onlytheirdeclared selectedoutput scope andresourceclosure, notwhole-project preservation; exportneverrebinds orclearsprojectdirty. Import-onlyroutes usea separate eligibleOBS-O01 savebranch, neveraninventedinputformatencoder."]],["references",["string","Newportableoutputs keep validatedrelativecomponents withinoutputroot, noabsolute/.. orsymlink/casealiases. Retain declared implicitpairs andsourcegroup order; never independentlyhashrename pairednames. Source parentpathcapture doesnotadmit thosepaths asportableoutputs. Hash-layoutnativeinteroperability remainsseparatelyunqualified."]],["resourceEffects",["string","density-resource-effect.contract.json: preserve complete current materialized Field data plus independent ordered original resources/operations/owner/descriptor. Default full source reopening restores the materialized snapshot; no implicit replay of source expressions, external recomputation or applying operations twice. All original SHA correct is insufficient when the derived field is missing or wrong."]],["unknownPreservation",["string","FullnativeSave mustactually preserve everyrequiredsourceproperty/opaque dependency through a qualifiedencoding/unchangedraw mapping. If the targetcannotexpress source-preservation metadata or a requiredresource association, E_UNSAFE_SOURCE_REWRITE; a side manifest listinghashes cannot repairprimary semantics orinvent scientificownership."]]]]],["schema",["string","FC-resource-reopen-contract/3"]],["scope",["string","Complete normative resource preservation and semantic reopen design requirements, not an implementation/qualification claim. Existing source capture/host gaps remain explicit."]],["selectedHistoricalNativeConsumption",["object",[["path",["string","historical-native-re