and old seals. No actual product/upstream protocol3 upgrade."]],["storedFieldCoverage",["string","Follow pinned FS storage: storedShape=coreShape+closure and IEEE754 little-endian. Check actual full byte count, finite active values, closure-implies-periodic and every face/edge/corner copy before source planning and independently after reopen. All matching file SHA with a wrong periodic corner still fails; core count alone cannot validate a closed payload. Independent scientific comparisons enumerate the qualified comparable core mapping and validate all storage/seam data separately; full source/raw retention remains exact."]],["typedSourceRestoration",["string","typed-source-restore.contract.json"]],["vectorSource",["string","native-vector-format-contract.json: enumerate vectors independently from source before checking returned objects, with exact owner/identity/parity/all associations/styles and qualified numeric frame budget. Source-only vector state is not active SG science. Legacy sticky parity/style upper-bit overwrite and old lost second-site moment are failed preserving behavior, not accepted projection."]]]]],["sgPersistentRootConservation",["string","sg-persistent-source.contract.json"]],["stateMachine",["object",[["cancellation",["string","Before approved publication, cancel stops the job and releases only owned private candidates after in-flight reads finish. Once publication may have begun, query the same owned operation and verify actual persisted semantics; no guaranteed rollback. Approved immutable snapshot completion settles captured ticket only, newer edits stay dirty. Exact composed identities/lifetime/close rules: save-settlement.contract.json."]],["candidateValidated",["string","Require completeSourceAudit, freshconsent, allownedbytes/leases, exactregisteredexpectedset, independentreferencevalidation andartifact-onlysemanticreadback beforehostpublish."]],["captured",["string","Noauthoritativewrites; plan/consentfailures retaincurrentproject/resources."]],["composedIdentitySettlement",["string","save-settlement.contract.json"]],["controlledClose",["string","Quiesceedits, resolveinflight/unknownoutcomes, capturelatestrevision, waititsmatchingSavedincludingsemanticproof, thenrelease/handoff. Failure restoreseditingandkeepsdirty; hardclose/crash cannotpromiseunsavedRAM recovery."]],["dependenciesVerified",["string","Onlynewimmutable names; readbackhash/length,retainoldreachablebytes. Anyfailurebeforeprimary leavesoldprimary authoritative; cleanonlyownedunreachablecandidates."]],["primaryPublished",["string","Primary-last publication isonly a possiblevisibility point. Durablecommitreceipt mustbindactual supportedhostprimitive/directory durability/writerboundary. Afterpossiblepublication, errors/cancel/disconnect arecommitted-unverified/unknown untilqueried, no blindrewriteor promisedrollback."]],["query",["string","Onlostack/restart/timeout queryactualprimary+allreferencedbytes andfrozencomparisonrules. SHAmatchalone isinsufficient; do notrerunEncodeApproved oroverwriteasquery. Ifvalidator/rule/source expectationunavailable keepunknown/recovery, notSaved. ExportsuccesscannotsetcurrentWorkRef."]],["saved",["string","Existinghost authenticated confirmation requiresdurablebytecommit ANDsemanticreadback ANDexactcapturedsnapshot identity. SavedR7cannotcleardirtyR8; oldepoch settlesonlyoldticket/history. saveAs rebindsonlymatchingcurrentdocument/epochsuccess; exportneverrebinds/clearsdraft/closesproject."]],["semanticVerified",["string","Allactualpersistedbytes andsource/content checksverifiedforcapturedbinding. Ifsemanticfailureafterpublish keepinmemorydraft/dirty, originalsandnewfiles + diagnostic, disableclose/Saved/rebind; noautomaticrollbackoverpossibleexternaledits. Offerrepair/reload/SaveAs onlyasnewexplicit operations afterresolve."]]]]],["wire",["string","resource-reopen.schema.json"]]]]]]],["object",[["logicalFile",["string","vesta-material:root/output/vesta-study/20261108-113622/reviews/20261115-092025-p1-03-completion/save-settlement.contract.json"]],["pointer",["string",""]],["projection",["string","complete-selected-JSON-value"]],["value",["object",[["binding",["object",[["host",["string","Host commit receipt states only the supported existing primitive/durability/writer boundary. It does not invent power-loss/network-directory durability, global Shell fencing or external-writer CAS. D2-13 check/use limits remain; original/no04 qualification is not silently upgraded."]],["operation",["string","One owned operationId binds the already registered source expectation, full preservation/consent binding, exact actual artifact set, approved actual target/base/lease context and frozen comparison rules. A different source, owner, revision, purpose, target or candidate needs its own operation/validation. TargetDigest comes from actual authorized host context, not a display filename."]],["receipts",["string","Candidate semantic validation, actual host commit and persisted semantic validation are separate internal completions. Each carries exactly the same operation/binding/artifact/target/rule identities and its own immutable verificationId. Only the authenticated internal job registry can vouch for completion; the client cannot register a passed flag, fabricated ID or arbitrary expectation."]],["source",["string","Actual complete source expectations are fixed before output exists. Output hashes and receipts never redefine expected objects; empty Field output against the real512-value source must fail before a semantic completion is issued."]],["targetRole",["string","Capture existing versus unbound-new binding role in the owned target context before planning; targetDigest binds exact purpose/role/target and contextual authority. Existing receipt wire stays unchanged. No mayRebind client grant."]]]]],["integration",["array",[["string","resource-reopen.contract.json"],["string","save-artifact-binding.contract.json"],["string","resource-content-comparison.contract.json"],["string","typed-source-restore.contract.json"]]]],["lifetime",["object",[["Saved",["string","A completed save/saveAs acknowledges the exact captured document/epoch/revision only. R7 ack cannot clear/close R8. Different document/epoch settles old ticket/history and cannot mutate currentWorkRef or resources."]],["close",["string","The close controller quiesces editing and resolves all in-flight/unknown operations, captures latest revision, then accepts only exact current lifetime/revision completion. Without quiescence an ack is not close authorization. Failure restores editing, retains draft/dirty. Hard close/crash does not promise unsaved RAM recovery."]],["export",["string","Even complete export only confirms that export operation. No projectSaved, currentWorkRef rebinding, dirty clearing or project close."]],["firstSave",["string","An unbound new project gains the acknowledged actual WorkRef only after complete same-document/epoch first Save; different current revision stays dirty. Existing Save retains its original WorkRef. SaveAs rebinds only on its own exact acknowledged target; export never rebinds. See selectedSaveTargetPolicy and actual controlled-writer race boundary."]],["idempotence",["string","Apply each owned operation completion once. Duplicate/late deliveries are checked against current lifetime and coordinator ticket; a previously consumed completion cannot grant a new close/rebind action."]],["inflightEdits",["string","Consent and pre-EncodeApproved submission validate the captured live identity. Once an approved job owns an immutable source snapshot and an exact save ticket, later edits do not mutate that input: completion can settle the captured revision only. Candidate not yet approved for publication must not be silently applied to a newer current snapshot; follow current coordinator/ticket validation. No stale result may mark the newer draft clean."]],["saveAs",["string","Successful same-document/epoch operation may bind the actually acknowledged authorized target while dirty is recomputed against its captured revision. A changed revision remains dirty; different-lifetime completion never rebinds."]]]]],["phases",["object",[["cancelled-before-publication",["string","No later stale candidate may publish. Only owned private cleanup after in-flight readers finish; original draft/resources remain."]],["candidate-pending",["string","No public output. Fresh complete-source audit/consent/reference closure, owned resource leases and authenticated artifact-only candidate semantic completion required before publication."]],["commit-unknown",["string","Preserve draft/dirty/old and new potentially reachable resources. No blind re-encode/retry, cleanup/rollback, rebinding, close or Saved. Query this owned host operation and actual persisted bytes; a positive byte comparison alone cannot invent a missing host operation receipt."]],["committed-unverified",["string","Authenticated host commit binds exact candidate bytes but semantic restoration remains unconfirmed. Missing field/ref/unit/table or invalid source metadata keeps this state with diagnostics; no Saved/close/rebind/automatic rollback over possible outside edits."]],["complete-for-captured-snapshot",["string","Actual persisted bytes/reference resolution/typed source and semantic object coverage match the captured source expectation under authenticated verifier completion. Reuse prepublish semantic evidence only if every artifact/context/rule input is proven equal. Readback from live old Engine/CWD/caches is disallowed."]],["not-published",["string","An authenticated host outcome proves primary not published; retain prior authoritative draft/resources, cleanup only owned unreferenced private artifacts after readers finish."]],["publishing",["string","Dependencies-first/primary-last underway. Beginning visibility cannot be undone by a client cancel. Any ambiguous completion enters commit-unknown."]]]]],["proofBoundary",["object",[["actualPayloadWitness",["string","typed-source-restore-witness.py compares all512 held source words in an authored selected full-root DTO and missing-Field negatives. It is not actual native/product restoration."]],["finiteModel",["string","save-settlement-model.py models authenticated completion as a conditional immutable registry; no real host, IPC authentication, persistence, active Engine or filesystem race implementation."]],["originalFailure",["string","The actual original saved3515-byte project still failed fresh volumetric reopen. These contracts do not convert it into a native pass."]]]]],["qualification",["object",[["actualAuthenticationImplemented",["bool",false]],["actualEngineImplemented",["bool",false]],["actualHostImplemented",["bool",false]],["designSpecified",["bool",true]],["independentlyReviewed",["bool",false]],["newTargetExecuted",["bool",false]],["whole03Complete",["bool",false]]]]],["queryAndCancel",["object",[["cancel",["string","Before publication cancel prevents later begin_publish. During publication stop new work safely and resolve the possible commit, no promised rollback. After verified commit, retain resources reachable from committed output; a cancel cannot erase confirmed data."]],["query",["string","After lost ack/cancel during publication, resolve actual owned operation outcome. If committed, verify actual persisted primary/dependencies/reference graph/full semantics. If not published, prove that outcome. Conflicting/missing validator/source expectation/rules/host evidence stays unknown or explicit readonly recovery. Query does not call EncodeApproved or perform a write."]]]]],["schema",["string","FC-save-settlement-design/1"]],["selectedSaveTargetPolicy",["object",[["path",["string","save-target-policy.contract.json"]],["scope",["string","D4-31 target selection and exact first-Save binding; selected source authority snapshot, no04 implementation"]],["sha256",["string","93ecc223741109edfcad15b5f1575945d439273601da23e0f5d407030db785a1"]]]]],["wire",["string","save-settlement.schema.json"]]]]]]]]]]]]